{"id":"n91843-1-7","stage":5,"title":"어처구니없다 · 荒唐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91843-1-7-1","ko":"아들이 아무 이유 없이 학교를 그만두겠다고 했다면서요?","zh":"听说你儿子无缘无故说要辍学了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아들이","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들이","audio":"/audio/66c10dc67bde9a897d9b.mp3"}},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么。","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"이유","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有。","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"9","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}},{"text":"학교를","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교를","audio":"/audio/5c0f3953da1ff7d62c97.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두겠다고","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두겠다고","audio":"/audio/e0e4ea823da75cf29f25.mp3"}},{"text":"했다면서요?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했다면서요","audio":"/audio/883b0949c74c524fbc56.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"理由或可能性等不成立地。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ec01a55dd7a03ec4ac2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91843-1-7-2","ko":"네. 하도 어처구니없어서 대꾸도 안 했어요.","zh":"是的。因为太荒谬了，我都没跟他多说话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"하도","meaning":"过于，太","explanation":"하도：过于，太。","readings":[{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84302","senseId":"1","lemma":"하도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}},{"text":"어처구니없어서","meaning":"荒唐","explanation":"어처구니없다：荒唐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"어처구니없다","audio":"/audio/5a263e7b92962514b8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91843","senseId":"1","lemma":"어처구니없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어처구니없어서","audio":"/audio/f9f232842e9326622a96.mp3"}},{"text":"대꾸도","meaning":"顶嘴，回话","explanation":"대꾸：顶嘴，回话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"대꾸","audio":"/audio/44928e6f9251fabaa5cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44503","senseId":"1","lemma":"대꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대꾸도","audio":"/audio/040756198e60b8de222e.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"做（대꾸를 하다：回应、搭话）","explanation":"하다：做（대꾸를 하다：回应、搭话）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"a69330a0e09b93c8","term":"하도","zh":"过于，太","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3","entryId":"84302","definition":"(强调)非常过分或特别大地。","pronun